    <string name="settings_nissan_navigation_hardware_volume_description">调高后，CarPlay 导航在 100% 时可以更响；原厂导航语音也会随之变化。最大 11，立即生效。</string>
    <string name="settings_nissan_navigation_hardware_volume_loading">读取中…</string>
